<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1 Thesalonika</book>
  <para style="h">1 Thesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Thesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Thesalonika</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Thesalonika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paula, Silvana leh Timothea chuan, Thesalonika khuaa Pa Pathian leh Lalpa Isua Krista kohhran chibai kan bûk e. Khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangniho avâng hian Pathian hnênah lâwmthu kan hril ṭhîn; kan ṭawngṭainaah te chuan bâng lovin in hming kan lam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rinna avânga ṭan in lâk dân te, hmangaihna avânga in thawhrimzia te, kan Lalpa Isuaa beiseina in nghah nghehzia te hi kan Pa Pathian hmaah kan hre reng ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Unaute u, Pathianin a hmangaih che u a, ama tân a thlang chhuak che u tih kan hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha in hnêna kan rawn thlen lai khân thu mai mai ni lovin, thiltihtheihna nên, Thlarau Thianghlim nên ring tlat chungin kan rawn sawi a nih kha; in zîngah eng angin nge in tân kan awm tih pawh in hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan awm dân leh Lalpa awm dân latute in lo ni ta a, hrehawm tam tak tuar chungin, Thlarau Thianghlima lâwmna nên thu chu in pawm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Makedonia leh Akaia rama ringtu zawng zawng tân entawn in ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Makedonia leh Akaia ramah Lalpa thu tûnah nangmahni aṭangin a darh mai ni lovin, hmun tinah Pathian in rin thu a thang ta a; chuvângin, keinin eng mah kan sawi a ṭûl ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan rawn tlawh che u ṭuma min lo lawm dân te, milem kalsana Pathian nung leh dik tak rawngbâwl tûra Pathian lam in lo hawi tâk thu te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A Fapa Isua, mitthi zîng ata a kaihthawh, thinur lo thleng tûr laka min chhan chhuaktu chu, vân aṭanga a lo kal nghâka in awm thu te an sawi huai huai a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute u, in hnêna kan lo kal kha a thlâwn lo tih nangmahni ngeiin in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In hriat angin Filipi khuaah khân zahthlâk taka sawisak tuar mah ila, dodâlna tam tak kârah in hnêna Chanchin Ṭha hril tûrin kan Pathianin min tihuai ta hlauh zâwk a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan thu hrilh che u hi thu dik lo emaw, thu bawlhhlawh emaw, bumna thu emaw a ni lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha kawltîr tlâka Pathianin min ruat ang ngeiin, mihring tilâwm tûr ni lovin, kan thinlung fiahtu Pathian tilâwm tûr zâwkin thu kan hril thîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eng lai mahin mi kan fak der ngai lo va, duhâm khuh nân thu kan sawi ngai hek lo tih in hria, Pathian pawhin a hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi min fak kan phût lo va, nangnin emaw, mi dangin emaw min fak kan ngiat hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Krista tirhkoh kan nih avângin in tân hautak zet ni thei mah ila, nuin a fate a duat angin kan duat zâwk che u kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuti taka kan ngainat che ua, kan hmangaih êm êm che u avângin, Pathian Chanchin Ṭha chauh ni lovin, keimahni nun lam pawh pêk hial che u kan peih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unaute u, kan thawh hahzia leh rimzia kha in hria e, in zîngah tu mah kan tihhautak lohna tûrin a chhûn a zâna hna rim taka thawk chungin Chanchin Ṭha kan hrilh ṭhin che u kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thianghlim leh fel leh demawm lo takin ringtute lakah kan awm ṭhîn tih hretute nangni in ni a, Pathian pawhin min hriatpui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pain a fate chunga a tih angin in zaa chungah kan ti ṭhîn tih in hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ram leh a ropuina chang ve tûra kotu che u Pathian mi ni tlâka awm tûrin kan ngênin kan fuihin kan hriattîr ṭhîn che u a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian bâng lovin Pathian hnênah lâwmthu kan sawi bawk ṭhîn, kan thu rawn hril in pawm lai khân, mihring thu anga pawm lovin, Pathian thutak pawma in pawm zâwk avâng khân. Pathian thu ngei a ni rêng a, nangni ringtuteah pawh a thawk bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Unaute u, nangni pawh Judai rama Pathian kohhranho Krista Isuaa awmte ang in ni, annin Juda-te laka an tuar angin nangni pawhin in mite lakah in tuar kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng Juda-te chuan Lalpa Isua leh zâwlneite an that a, keini pawh min tiduhdah a, Pathian an tilâwm lo va, mi dang pawh dodâl loh an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jentail-te chhandam an nih vena tûra Chanchin Ṭha an hnêna kan hrilh min khap a, an sual vâwrtâwp an thleng a, Pathian thinurna an chungah a lo thleng ta nge nge a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Unaute u, thinlung lamah ni lovin, taksa lamah hun eng emaw chhûng kan inṭhen rih a; chuvângin, in hmêl hmuh leh kan châk takmeuh a, hmuh tum che uin kan bei nasa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rawn tlawh che u kan tum ṭhîn a, kei Paula ngei pawh hian vawi hnih vawi thum ka tum tawh a; mahse, Setanan min dâl ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua lo kal leh hunah, a hmaa hmuh kan beisei tûr, kan hlimna tûr, chawimawina chhuanawm kan khum tûr chu nangni lo tu dang nge ni ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangni hi kan ropuina tûr leh kan hlimna tûr chu in ni asin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In chanchin hre lova awm kan theih tâk loh avângin keini chauh hi Atheni khuaah awm hnufual ila ṭha kan ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tichuan, kan unaupa Timothea, Krista Chanchin Ṭha hrila Pathian rawng kan bâwlpui hi in rinna tinghet tûr leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />hêng tihduhdahnate avânga in zînga mi tu mah in nghîn loh nân fuih tûr che u-in kan rawn tîr a ni. Nangni pawhin hêng hi kan tuar ngei tûr a ni tih in hriat kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In hnêna kan awm lai khân tihduhdahna kan tuar dâwn tih kan hrilh lâwk che u kha, chutiang ngei chuan a lo thleng ta tih in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rinnaa in ngheh zêl leh zêl loh hre lova awm reng kan theih loh avângin Timothea kha kan rawn tîr a ni; thlêmtuin thlêm thlu che u-in, kan hna thawh a thlâwn mai dah ang e tih hlauva rawn tîr kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Timothea chu in hnên ata a lo thleng leh ta a, chanchin lâwmawm tak, in rin nghehzia te, hmangaihna in ngahzia te, keinin hmuh che u kan châk êm êm ang bawka min hmuh in châk ve thu te, eng lai pawhin min hre reng a ni tih te min rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, unaute u, in rinna a ngheh avângin kan manganna leh kan hrehawmna zawng zawngah thlamuang takin kan awm thei ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpaa in ngheh zêl avâng hian tûnah chuan kan tân dam man a awm ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangmahni zâra Pathian hmaa kan hlimna zawng zawng avâng hian a hnênah lâwmthu hrilh kan va ba nasa êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In hmêl kan hmuh theihna tûr leh rinna lama in tlâkchham kan phuhrûksak theihna tûr che uin Pathian hnênah chhûn leh zân ṭhahnemngai takin kan dîl ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan Pa Pathian ngei leh kan Lalpa Isua chuan in hnêna kan lo kalna tûr kawng min siamsak rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan hmangaih che u ang taka nasaa in inhmangaih theih nân leh mi zawng zawng in hmangaih theih nân, in hmangaihna chu Lalpan tiṭhangin tihpunsak che u rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, kan Lalpa Isua chuan, a mi thianghlim zawng zawng nên a lo kal hunah, Pathian kan Pa hmaah chuan thianghlim leh sawisêlbova awm thei tûrin in thinlung tinghet rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tâwp berah chuan unaute u, Pathian tilâwm zâwnga nun dân kan hnên aṭanga in dawn ang khân in awm a, chutianga awm zêl tûrin Lalpa Isua hmingin kan ngên che u a, kan fuih bawk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa Isua thuneihna hmangin eng thu nge kan pêk che u in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hei hi Pathian duhzâwng chu a ni - in thianghlim hi; inngaih bânsan rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In zînga mi tu pawhin mahni taksa vawng thiamin, thianghlim leh chawimawi tlâkin vawng ṭheuh ula.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian hre lo Jentail-te angin tisa châknaah tlu lût suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He thilah hian tu man a unau bumin a lakah thil ṭha lo ti suh se; chutiang titute chungah chuan Lalpan phuba a la ang tih kan hrilhin kan hriattîr tawh che u kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian chuan bawlhhlawh taka nung tûr ni lovin, thianghlim taka nung tûrin min ko zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, he thu pawisa lo chuan mihring a pawisa lo a ni lo va, Thlarau Thianghlim petu che u Pathian chu a pawisa lo a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unaute inhmangaihna thu chu in tân ziak a ngai lo ve, Pathianin nangmahni ngei inhmangaih tawn a zirtîr si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutiangin, Makedonia rama unau zawng zawng chungah pawh in tih ṭhin kha. Unaute u, chu hmangaihna chu ngah lehzual tûrin kan ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan hrilh tawh che u ang khân, ngawi renga in kuta mahni hna thawh uar rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, pâwn lam mite hmuhah mawi takin in khawsa thei ang a, eng mah tlâkchham in nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unaute u, beiseina rêng nei lo mi dangte anga in lungngaih loh nân muhîlte chanchin in hriat loh kan duh lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Isua a thi a, a tho leh tih kan ring si a, chutiang bawk chuan Isuaa muhîl tawhte pawh Pathianin ama rualin a rawn hruai ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa thuin hei hi kan hrilh a che u: Keini Lalpa lo kal thlenga nungdama lo la awm rengte hian muhîl tawhte chu kan lehkhalh tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa ngei chu thu pe au âw nên, vântirhkoh ropui ber aw nên, Pathian tawtawrâwt ri nên vân aṭangin a lo chhuk ang a, Kristaa thi tawhte chu an tho hmasa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan keini nungdama la awm rengte hi, boruakah Lalpa hmuak tûrin, anmahni rualin chhûm zîngahte khian lâk chhohvin kan awm ang a, Lalpa hnênah kan awm kumkhua tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, hêng thute hian lo inthlamuan tawn ṭhîn rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, unaute u, a hun leh a ni thute ziaksak in ngai lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa Nî chu zâna rûkru lo kal angin a lo thleng dâwn tih nangmahni ngeiin chiang takin in hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“A him e, a muanawm e,” an tih laiin hmeichhe nau vei angin chhiatna an chungah a lo thleng thut ang a, an pumpelh tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Unaute u, nangni erawh chu thimah in awm loh avângin chumi ni chuan rûkru angin a nang lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In vaiin êng fate leh ni fate in ni vek si a. Zâna mi kan ni lo va, thima mi kan ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi dangte angin i muhîl suh ang u khai, mengin i ngaihven zâwk ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Muhîlte chu zânah an muhîl ṭhîn a, zu ruite pawh zânah a ni an ruih ṭhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keini zawng chhûna mi kan nih avâng hian, rinna leh hmangaihna âwmphaw chu ha-in, chhandam beiseina chu lukhuma hmangin, harhfîm takin i awm zâwk ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathianin thinurna tuar tûr ni lovin, kan Lalpa Isua Krista zâra chhandam ni tûrin min ruat zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan dam emaw, kan thi emaw, amah nên kan nun tlân theih nân ani chu kan tân a thi si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, inthlamuan tawnin, intichak tawn rawh u, in tih fo ṭhin ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unaute u, in tân rim taka thawktu, Lalpaa nangmahni enkawltute leh zilhtute chu hre reng tûrin kan ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anni chu an hna thawh avânga ngaisâng êm êmin hmangaih ula, inngeih dial dial rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, unaute u, ka ngên a che u, mi dâwngdahte zilh ula, mi beidawngte chu thlamuan ula, mi chak lote ṭanpui ula, mi zawng zawng dawhthei rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu sual mah suala thungrûl lo tûrin fîmkhur ula, eng lai pawha thil ṭha intihsak tawn zâwkin mi zawng zawng chungah thil ṭha ti zêl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lâwm fo ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />bâng lovin ṭawngṭai ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />engkimah lâwmthu hril fo rawh u. Hei hi Krista Isuaah chuan Pathianin in tih a duh chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thlarau chu timit suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuhrilte pawh hmusit suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A enga pawh chu fiah hmasa ula, a ṭha chu pawm tlat ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />a ṭha lo apiang tlânsan rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Remna Pathian ngei chuan in pumin tithianghlim che u sela, kan Lalpa Isua Krista lo kal hunah chuan in thlarau leh in rilru leh in taksa a puma sawisêlbovin awmtîr rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A kotu che u chu a rinawm a, tih pawh a ti ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Unaute u, min ṭawngṭaisak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Unau zawng zawng kha kut vuanin chibai mi bûksak ṭheuh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />He lehkha hi unau zawng zawng hriata chhiar tûrin Lalpa hmingin ka ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna chu in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
